# Local/pitch configuration is generated automatically by npm run demo.
# Complete API settings: backend/api/.env.example -> backend/api/.env
# Complete Expo settings: frontend/.env.example -> frontend/.env.local
# Do not copy endpoint overrides into the frontend for Expo Go.
# No real Firebase credentials, Expo login, or production secrets are required.
# Optional binary discovery override when MySQL Server is not on PATH:
# MYSQLD_PATH=/path/to/mysql/bin/mysqld
# On macOS/Linux a running local MySQL 8 service is also supported.
# No environment file at the repository root is required for demo startup.
